{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>新宣傳片：</p>\n<p>《皇牌空戰》系列長年來在Strangereal世界中編織出宏偉的歷史敍事。現在就讓我們回顧《皇牌空戰8：希孚之翼》之前的故事。本作將於2026年10月2日發售，登陸PC/PS5/XSX平台。</p>\n<p>視頻截圖：</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290739_448429_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_989994_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_735312_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_800769_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_690546_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_157088_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>新宣傳片：</p>\n\n<p>視頻截圖：</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290739_448429_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_989994_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_735312_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_800769_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_690546_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《皇牌空戰8》新宣傳片 展現遊戲世界壯闊空戰歷史\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260706/1783290740_157088_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T23:58:20.244402+00:00","qualit